Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Truth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 27
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a harsh reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no strength left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Has everyone betrayed me, just like Jay and Wolffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you traitor—what are you doing back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.18,0:00:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought them back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss…Boss…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.66,0:00:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, we were ambushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.69,0:01:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We were surrounded by Guangzong’s men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Wolffy and the others who helped us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.01,0:01:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Wolffy and the others stepping in to save us;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,otherwise, we wouldn’t have been able to see you again, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Wolffy saved you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just looking for you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.25,0:01:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,when we saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.26,0:01:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I felt that you aren’t bad at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.30,0:01:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And we aren’t Guangzong’s subordinates, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.58,0:01:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then…then who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.41,0:01:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, we don’t belong in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been working under you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,just to use your vehicle to find a rift back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to catch Blue Scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to help my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don’t have a vehicle anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.89,0:01:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.89,0:01:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.49,0:01:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But right now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.21,0:01:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,my gear has been destroyed by that traitor, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.56,0:01:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve lost completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven’t lost yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.41,0:01:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t actually need that gear at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:02:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You possess a far greater power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What other power do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.20,0:02:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the Desert Overlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And subordinates who have always been fiercely loyal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You guys…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright then, let’s go find Blue Scarf first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.59,0:02:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you’d complete the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.18,0:02:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where’s the information I wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t forget the agreement between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t try anything funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn’t dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.38,0:03:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi’er
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.58,0:03:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.53,0:03:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re surprised, aren’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.75,0:03:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You thought
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I had died from that gunshot back then, didn’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi’er
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been looking for you all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.26,0:03:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you treat me that way back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.35,0:03:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me find another water source.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you end up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t be so cold, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I only found that water source back then thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed to share the water source we found with everyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the end, you broke your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Mei, don’t be so naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,How many bottles of water is a promise worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.75,0:04:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you help me unlock the secrets of this underground city,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.46,0:04:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll share the water here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t trust you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever dared to say no to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just how terrifying Guangzong is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Once he finds out you’re by my side now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.75,0:04:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid he’ll use you to threaten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I told a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because only then
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,could I let you leave me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and leave this dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re lying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If that were true
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.74,0:04:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn’t you leave with me back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Because
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,the ruins I was investigating
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,held a secret concerning the world’s water supply
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.67,0:04:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn’t let Guangzong monopolize the water source again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to stay and stop him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.15,0:04:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how do you explain
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:04:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,this gunshot wound I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don’t leave now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.47,0:05:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t blame me for being ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.34,0:05:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Guangzong really did use you to threaten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He actually laid a hand on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.44,0:05:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, that blow I struck
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,helped you avoid a fatal wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Guangzong…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can work with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.63,0:05:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,but you have to promise me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that she stays alive
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All these years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.32,0:05:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve kept an eye on how you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Only when I learned you could protect yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.01,0:05:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,did I truly breathe a sigh of relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.88,0:05:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I plotted to escape Guangzong’s captivity,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.89,0:05:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,it was all in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,for the way I treated you back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:05:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How could…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,it be like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a pity you found out too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.45,0:06:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Another intruder—intercept them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over Xiao Mei now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You are…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.26,0:06:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t come to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The person you’ve spent so many years searching for in vain—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.11,0:06:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,yet Guangzong claims to have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,news about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.71,0:06:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just want answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,have you never trusted me at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Today is a good day to settle old scores.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.03,0:07:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sneaking in while they’re in chaos…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, you really pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.47,0:07:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s find them quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does Guangzong have this photo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.93,0:07:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fragment
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t think a mere two people
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,could defeat me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said there were only two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.98,0:07:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Guangzong
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the one who destroyed my village!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.19,0:08:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I’ve been found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing with your own eyes your father sacrifice himself for the village…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.07,0:08:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,was quite something, wasn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.98,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.39,0:08:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay, why are you working for Guangzong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because when I was at death’s door,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the Lord extended a helping hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He is my benefactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.23,0:08:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Cha Erlang gained that magical power,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,he became a threat to my benefactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,To repay that debt of gratitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I infiltrated your circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You shameless scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.70,0:08:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand Xiao Mei over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That glow…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.19,0:08:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Jay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.66,0:08:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the secret of the Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.72,0:09:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t you dare hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve already found Xiao Mei, the one who can unlock the secret of the Aqua Pearl, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You are no longer of any use.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.93,0:10:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom…Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.33,0:10:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.49,0:10:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.78,0:10:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is very unfavorable for us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s retreat for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Big…sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.53,0:11:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the one who should be saying sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, I couldn’t protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But at the very end,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.09,0:11:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to be able to see the two of you again
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,is truly wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For so many years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept misunderstanding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.92,0:11:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,When, in fact, you were the one most worthy of trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.56,0:11:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,—Yet I doubted you…—Don’t blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The one at fault is that greedy, devious guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.55,0:11:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to live together, Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Xi’er…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask a favor of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d like you to escort Xiao Mei to the Droplet Research Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,counting
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.37,0:11:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.37,0:12:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom…Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.09,0:12:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely complete the mission you entrusted to me.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
